'''Krahnoviir''' is a [[Online:Bone Dragon|Bone Dragon]] raised by [[Online:Mannimarco|Mannimarco]] when you activate the [[Online:Voskrona Colossal|Voskrona Colossal]] during battle.
{{NewLeft}}

==Related Quests==
* {{Quest Link|The Final Dark}}

==Skills and Abilities==
As an elite rank creature, Krahnoviir is immune to crowd control, the exception being the [[ON:Voskrona Colossal|Voskrona Colossal]]'s ability "Entangle" which stuns it instead.
;Bone Wyrm Resurrection:Upon being summoned by Mannimarco, a growing area forms under its bones. When filled it deals low [[ON:Physical Damage|physical damage]] in the large area.  
;Necrotic Bolt:Krahnoviir spits a necrotic ball at its target as a basic ranged attack dealing minor [[ON:Disease Damage|disease damage]] then half that amount in disease damage every half second over 8 seconds.
;Necrosis Breath:Krahnoviir briefly breathes in a cone, dealing three ticks of direct low disease damage.
;Corroded Bones: Upon reaching 66% and 33% {{ESO Health Link}}, Krahnoviir roars and gets a [[ON:Damage Shield|damage shield]] of 100% of its {{ESO Health Link|Max}}. The first time it also gets a 30% increase of its damage done for the rest of the fight.
;Necrotic Overload:When the Voskrona Colossal's "Entangle" stun nears its end, a growing area forms under Krahnoviir. When filled it deals extreme disease damage in the large area.

==Notes==
* "Krahnoviir" means Cold-{{huh}}-Dying in the dragon language.
